### Learner 61, page 1 - expect 10 lessons
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming

### Learner 61, page 3 - expect the last 6 lessons
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?page=3

### Learner 61, 5 per page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?page=2&limit=5

### Page past the end - expect an empty list
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?page=9

### Learner 62 - no upcoming lessons, expect an empty list
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/62/lessons/upcoming

### User 1 is a tutor - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/1/lessons/upcoming

### Learner that doesn't exist - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/9999/lessons/upcoming

### Invalid ID - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/abc/lessons/upcoming

### Invalid page - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?page=0

### Limit too large - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?limit=500

### Unknown route - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/nothing

