### SPRINT 2

### Tutor 7's languages - expect 200, Korean
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tutors/7/languages

### Tutor not approved - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tutors/52/languages

### Book a lesson - expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-11-25T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### Same booking again - expect 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-11-25T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

